WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:05.969
Demon souls begins with the old one,
 an eldritch great one, descending upon the earth.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:12.220
Once awakened it inspires a hierarchy of demons 
dedicated to the retrieval of every soul

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.220
in exchange for great power.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.360
In the evil ending, deep below the Nexus every soul is given to the old one and a great fog blankets the world.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.430
Eons later, deep below a gray land, covered in fog

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:31.440
four hollow beings discover an immense amount of souls

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.800
and the story of Dark Souls begins.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.060
The fog is dispersed,

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.920
civilization is reborn

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.120
and Souls flourish anew.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.560
However, the irrevocable poison
 of the old one persists.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:49.080
And eventually humanity looks for an escape from this cursed world.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:52.540
They find a way out through a painted world of blood

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:55.620
and as the tale of blood-borne begins

00:00:56.379 --> 00:01:00.448
Humanity creeps ever closer to the eldritch truth 
that they've forgotten,

00:01:01.149 --> 00:01:05.188
strengthened by the echoes of the past,
found within the blood.

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:11.070
This is an argument for the shared timeline 
of the souls borne universe.

00:01:11.439 --> 00:01:18.389
And I'll be honest it's kind of a lesson in 
how easy it can be to push an entertaining theory.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.940
Just as long as you cherry-pick only the evidence that suits your narrative.

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:26.820
It's really dishonest to tell a story in that way.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.900
But it is a lot of fun.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:33.380
So from your perspective, I hope it's interesting for you to sort of try and find

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:35.240
the gaps that I'm leaving in my logic

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:42.060
First let's establish that the old one is a great one from Lovecraftian fiction.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.680
so the great ones as described by HP Lovecraft

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:50.620
Are cosmic deities that are so inconceivable and horrific

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:55.180
to humanity that they often shatter the minds of those who encounter them.

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.880
As an example of this let me introduce you

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:01.780
to these renditions of Azathoth and Shub-Niggurath

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:07.180
both of whom are very similar in some ways to the old one of demon souls.

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:11.380
So Azathoth is commonly called the nuclear chaos,

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:15.000
the blind idiot God, 
who resides at the center of the universe.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.780
He rules all time and space,

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:22.820
yet his chaotic and really unpredictable, Idiotic nature

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:28.740
inspires this fear, that he could accidentally bring about the end of the world at any time.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:35.720
According to Lovecraft, Azathoth is lulled by the thin monotonous piping of a demonic flute.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:39.680
And many writers of Lovecraftian fiction take this music

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:45.740
as an attempt to soothe Azathoth and
 his chaos into a dormant lulled state.

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:51.679
Similarly, of course, the old one of demon souls 
also appears to lack intelligence.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:56.200
It's also wholly capable of bringing about the end of the world.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.060
As the last time it was awakened, 
it erased half the world in fog

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:04.060
this world was only saved 
by the efforts of the Monumentals

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:10.400
who lulled the great one back to slumber and set about preserving the fabric of reality

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:12.000
That remained.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.229
Sound familiar?

00:03:13.229 --> 00:03:15.229
Consider also Shub-niggurath

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:17.320
Mother of a thousand young, who is depicted as this great floating entity made of mouths,

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:22.160
who is depicted as this great,
 floating entity made of mouths,

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:25.980
tentacles, and lesser creatures 
that emerge from its body.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:33.109
This being is the subject of a lot of worship 
and in fact it consumes its most worthy

00:03:33.389 --> 00:03:37.758
Worshipers and then spits them out
 as an immortal being.

00:03:37.759 --> 00:03:41.149
This is not unlike our widely worshipped old one.

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:46.399
Which is also a great floating entity
 which spawned all of demon kind

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:52.939
And one who consumes the slayer of demons 
at the end of the game, in return for great power.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:58.409
In addition, like many of Blood Bones great ones,
 the old one comes from the ocean.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:06.029
Not only that, but like Lovecraft's great ones the old ones very nature cannot be fathomed by the living.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:10.240
Finally there's a place called Latria in Demon Souls,

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:13.820
which you should remember from your PTSD, 
if you've played the game and

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:21.240
Latria is actually a theological term for worship.
 In this place many have been evolved to a

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:28.580
Higher state of being thanks to their proximity to their God, whom it is revealed, is the old one.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:33.280
And a lot of these transformations are definitely Lovecraftian in style.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:39.560
So, while I don't recommend
you buy into this shared Timeline theory  that I'm peddling

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:42.740
One thing you absolutely can take from this

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:48.080
is just how far back From Software's Lovecraftian inspirations go.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:55.000
It's the cosmic horror of the old one that makes it such a great antagonist for demon souls, one-hundret percent!

00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:01.380
And once it lures you to its side, in the evil ending, when all souls have been channeled into this

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:06.900
unfathomable deposit of energy when a grey, deep fog envelops the world

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:11.920
We have the perfect transition into the Dark Souls universe,

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:16.260
where millennia later it's easy to imagine latent hollows

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.300
Stumbling upon these souls of Lords deep below the earth

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:25.469
These souls from the old one have combusted, to create the first flame

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.040
And when you think about it the body of the old one would have made

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:36.900
for fantastic kindling so these four husks inherit the condensed souls of the old one deep below the earth.

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:41.120
And with these they dispel 
the gray fog that's above them.

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:47.000
Because a soul, after all, as defined by the monumental is the essence with which living things

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:49.380
comprehend the world around them.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:53.740
Fog actually represents a lack of clarity and with souls

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:58.220
Hollows are granted the clarity to pierce the fog.

00:05:58.220 --> 00:06:01.500
Demon Souls actually has one of the best and only

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:06.160
definitions of the concepts of souls
 and fog in the souls universe

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:09.100
and so a new world is created by the Lords.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:13.900
And the structure of this world is really similar to the world of demon souls.

00:06:14.139 --> 00:06:20.668
A Core law of the world is that the strong will always dominate the weak and souls will naturally

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:25.580
Coalesce towards powerful entities as a result of this.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:29.300
The chosen Undead, the bearer of 
the curse, the ashen one,

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:36.660
every iteration of this world moves towards a state of entropy where all the souls are held by one being.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.340
Just like it did in Demon Souls

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:44.860
This process is assisted by a maiden ,
who's able to channel Souls in every game.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:49.340
Perhaps it's no surprise that these maidens
 began to obscure their sight

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:54.340
and dress in black over time 
just like their ancestor once did.

00:06:54.940 --> 00:07:02.429
Notice how this new world also retains the twin arts of miracles and sorcery and just like in Demon Souls

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:06.600
It's rumored that both these arts share the same source.

00:07:06.789 --> 00:07:11.909
In demon souls for example the talisman of beasts reveals, that both miracles and

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:18.359
Sorceries draw upon the power of the old one and in Dark Souls there are items like velka's talisman

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:24.700
Which reveal that miracles can indeed be cast 
with intelligence alone

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.880
and sorceries paradoxically with faith.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:27.900
You might ask:

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:32.700
"What is pyromancy, then?"
and even demon souls explains that because

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:39.320
Demon Souls had flame sorcery and Dark Souls mentions that flame sorcery was once a thing.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:43.280
And of course, at the core of Dark Souls is the curse.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:49.020
In every age there's this effort to gain insight into 
this cursed existence.

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:54.380
As kings and scholars both attempt to 
look deeper into souls

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:57.020
for answers and an escape.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.130
However

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:03.520
"The soul and the curse are one in the same"
The soul is the curse.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:07.940
The Curse is irrevocably tied to the soul, reminding us

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:11.880
of a certain poison, that was placed upon the earth millennia ago.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:20.420
On the first day mankind was granted a soul and on the second, upon earth was planted an irrevocable poison.

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:22.320
A soul-devouring demon.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:28.420
The curse is characterized by being soul-devouring and the old ones poison is irrevocable

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.660
Just like the curse

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:33.640
And I think that when it consumed every soul in demon souls

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:38.800
For the lords to eventually absorb
 at the start of Dark Souls

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:42.560
it became an inseparable part of souls themselves.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:43.400
A curse.

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:44.400
A poison.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:48.400
The only thing that transcends the soul and the poison of the old one

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:53.640
Is whatever God placed them there on the first and second day of creation.

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:58.580
And so if one wants answers, one would have the glance towards the heavens.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:02.380
So as we move towards Bloodborne,
 consider Chester of Oolacile

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:07.340
He's dressed in a hunter's attire. 
He has rose daggers that cause bleeding

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:10.920
and he also favors a crossbow, in a world without guns.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:14.980
Chester looks like he belongs in Yharnam,
 not Oolacile.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:19.380
Indeed, perhaps he's proof that yharnam is what the future holds.

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:21.500
hmm

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:26.559
"Let me guess. Snatched by a shadowy limb and dragged off to the past?

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:33.580
Yes, of course exactly what happened to me. 
We are both strangers in this strange land."

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:39.639
So if blood-borne takes place in the future how did the inhabitants of this world get there?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:43.740
How did they escape the curse of their own Souls?

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:47.560
And the answer, 
as characters in souls slowly began to realize,

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:48.880
was blood.

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:53.800
A substance which is mentioned 
more and more as the series progresses

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:59.520
Get this in Dark Souls 2 the drake blood knights 
began to worship the blood of dragons

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:04.760
which they believed would allow them to understand life
 and transcend existence

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:08.940
Concepts that are very familiar to Bloodborne players.

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:14.220
In Dark Souls 3 the sacred blood of the wolf was spread amongst the abyss watchers

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:18.430
And their souls became one,
with the soul of the wolfblood master.

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:24.240
It's our first sign that blood is sort of a vessel for souls and the curse.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:30.080
In ashes of Ariandelle we see Bloods ability to appease the flame, just like a soul would.

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:36.820
And in the ringed City the primal link to blood is confirmed, with gales consumption of the blood of the Dark Soul

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:41.620
And its subsequent retrieval for the creation of Arias painting.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:45.840
So Vendrick believed that the answer to the curse lay within the soul itself,

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:53.220
But in reality to escape we would have to understand that blood is a powerful human defining resource,

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:55.020
iust like souls are.

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:59.920
And so, with the world painted with
 the most primal blood imaginable

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:06.729
humanity separates their cursed Souls from the blood, 
leaving the old ones poison behind, and

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.950
escaping the world of Dark Souls,

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:16.419
traveling or born by blood to a new world, but they can become closer to the insight that they crave.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:21.600
Symbolically Yanam ends up being built 
above the chalice dungeons below

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:24.640
and many of these contain knights in plate armor.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:27.980
from the medieval times of demons and Dark Souls.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:33.800
In this world of Bloodborne blood alone contains the powerful echoes of the past

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:37.320
and the concept of a soul no longer exists.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:39.840
Hence the curse no longer exists.

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:44.540
Humanity, now relying on blood, instead of the souls that they left behind,

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:47.700
has escaped the irrevocable poison of the old one.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:51.800
But they remain under the influence of great ones, 
just like it.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.960
Similar to how Demon Souls revolves directly around the old one,

00:11:56.300 --> 00:12:00.600
The story of Bloodborne revolves directly around the revelations about the great ones

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:03.980
many of which can be extended to the old one as well.

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:10.240
The motivations of these elder beings are mysterious and they're incomprehensible to mankind.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.700
Except for one thing,

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:12.680
childbirth.

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:14.820
The great ones crave children,

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:18.900
yet paradoxically their children are always destined to die.

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:23.520
To solve this problem 
they often have surrogate children, through humans

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:28.480
Viewed in this way the old one is no different to the great ones in Bloodborne.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:30.020
Think about it

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:35.400
It's an entity with the goal of grooming a child called a slayer of demons

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:37.620
and the old one itself had to die as well

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.800
In order for its poison to survive

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:48.160
Interestingly there is an undeniable link to demon souls that ended up being cut from Bloodborne early in development.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.860
In the word Umbasa.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:55.900
In Demon Souls umbasa was a word of reverence that was often spoken by priests and miracle users.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:59.780
Listen to Gascoigne's dialogue, which was present in the network test

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:03.860
Sick creature, may you rest in peace

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:05.340
Umbasa.

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:10.900
And to this random Yharnamite, extracted from the game's files,  only recently.

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:16.580
"Give your blessing 
and wash from us the blood of beasts. Umbasa."

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:22.120
The use of this word hints at a rediscovery of a god that was introduced in Demon Souls

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:26.380
and lost in Dark Souls. 
A God that granted humans a soul

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:29.300
But also granted them the poison of the old one

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:35.600
This was a litany of stories that eventually ended in the Ascension of mankind in Bloodborne ,

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:38.240
To a new eldritch childhood

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:43.760
where they are finally on even footing,
 with the so-called gods, that started it all.

